    "description": "Sato Shoji Corporation sells iron and steel products, non-ferrous metals, machines, electronic materials, industrial tools, lifestyle goods, precious metals and jewelry, construction materials, and environment-related goods in Japan. The company offers surface-treated steel sheets, cold-rolled steel sheets, pickled steel sheets, hot-rolled steel sheets, steel bars and bar steel, structural carbon steel sheets, structural carbon steel, structural alloy steel and tool steel, as well as construction materials and equipment mainly to the automobile, construction and agricultural machinery, building, electrical machinery, shipbuilding, and mold and die industries. It also sells aluminum, zinc, copper, tin, lead, nickel, magnesium, silicon, manganese, bismuth, copper products, phosphor bronze, extruded products, processed goods using aluminum cutting, CFRP, resin composite products, GMT, non-ferrous metal scrap, hastelloy, inconel and stainless steel, as well as components, including block rings, cast and wrought, die cast, stainless processed, heat exchangers, lost-wax, peripheral equipment, and other products. In addition, the company offers materials for printed circuit board, semiconductor and liquid crystal, electronic components, and automotive related and other products used in mobile phones and household appliances, such as personal computers and digital cameras, sub-materials, equipment and machines related to manufacturing; and machinery and tools products, such as machining tools, forging machine, automation, various machines, cutting tools, and others products. Further, it provides the Martian, DANSK, and Sori Yanagi branded Western crockery and cutlery, precious metals and accessories, as well as tableware and kitchen goods. The company was founded in 1930 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
